rn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Net cash of $461.1m against total assets of $478.2m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-0.7% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 91.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"},{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 184.1% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-1956.7% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $21.5m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"},{"text":"About 33 months of cash at the current burn ($461.1m against $170.0m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000193765326000034/0001937653-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001937653-26-000034"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 4.4% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (6,120 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000210444626000009/0002104446-26-000009-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.2% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1937653/000210444626000009/0002104446-26-000009-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -106.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-1.06,"consecutive":2,"current":-0.911,"current_display":"-91.1%","threshold_display":"-106.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","comparison":"below","threshold":12.0,"consecutive":1,"current":32.547,"current_display":"33 months","threshold_display":"12 months","fired":false,"rationale":"Below twelve months the company raises on whatever terms it can get, and that dilution lands on you.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilutio